  "views_to": "physical/ref_tile/hfd_hgi_vms_glue_nw_g8r/views",
  "structural_change": "g8m MAIN (HBMc/SVGSMH-VMG 10-21) = g8r + placement fix: g8r GPL-0305 NaN because ORFS buffer_ports inserted 21,363 (SW) / 20,107 (NW) port buffers AFTER the band fence hook, ungrouped, into the Top-level region whose free area is 0 (three bands tile the whole core; GPL-0302 target density -0.25). Every port already lands on a FIRM pin flop at its pin (io_flop_at_pins), so DONT_BUFFER_PORTS=1 (no port buffers) and GPL_TIMING_DRIVEN=0 (no timing-driven buffer insertion outside the bands), the proven SMH r6 band-fence recipe 22cfcca3f. Every cell is in its band; fences dissolved pre-DPL. No RTL / edge / outline change."
 },
